sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant MW as MainWindow
    participant P as LinkGraphPanel
    participant W as LinkGraphWorker
    participant B as LinkGraphBuilder
    participant E as Engine
    participant V as LinkGraphViewer

    Note over U,MW: === P2-6 跨文件链接图谱 ===
    U->>MW: 点击右栏"链接图谱"Tab
    MW->>P: load()
    P->>W: start()
    W->>B: build(engine)
    loop 每篇 markdown（多源）
        B->>E: get_indexed_files / get_file_content / sources
        B->>B: extract_links + resolve_link(按源根映射)
    end
    B-->>W: LinkGraph
    W-->>P: finished(graph)
    P->>V: display_graph(graph)
    Note over MW,P: 打开/选中某文章时
    MW->>P: highlight_for_file(path)
    P->>V: 高亮邻居 + 填充"本文引用"列表
    U->>V: 点击节点
    V->>P: node_clicked(path)
    P->>MW: link_jump(path)
    MW->>MW: _show_file_in_viewer(path)

    Note over U,MW: === P2-12 近似/重复文章检测 ===
    participant D as DuplicateDialog
    participant WD as DuplicateDetectWorker
    participant DD as DuplicateDetector
    participant VS as VectorStore
    U->>MW: 点击顶栏"重复检测"
    MW->>D: 打开对话框
    U->>D: 选阈值 + "开始检测"
    D->>WD: start()
    WD->>DD: find_duplicate_pairs(engine, threshold)
    loop 每篇已索引文件
        DD->>VS: get_file_vector(file_path)   %% 不调 encode
    end
    DD->>DD: 余弦相似度(分块) 收集 sim≥threshold 的 (i<j) 对
    DD-->>WD: List[DuplicatePair]
    WD-->>D: finished(pairs)
    D->>D: 渲染列表(文件名 + 相似度%)
    U->>D: 点击某相似对
    D->>MW: pair_selected(file_a, file_b)
    MW->>MW: _show_file_in_viewer(选中篇)
